---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Dr Yameen Qureshi | Insight Medicolegal" description="Consultant Psychiatrist and independent psychiatric expert witness based in Glasgow.">
  <section class="inner-page">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="page-head">
        <h1>Dr Yameen Qureshi</h1>
        <p class="page-lead">Consultant Psychiatrist and independent psychiatric expert witness based in Glasgow.</p>
      </header>
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-artwork" aria-hidden="true">
          <p class="about-artwork__quotation">Measured<br />judgement.<br /><em>Clear opinion.</em></p>
          <span class="about-artwork__signoff">Insight Medicolegal</span>
        </div>
        <div class="about-bio">
          <section class="editorial-section">
            <h2>Clinical background</h2>
            <p>Dr Qureshi has dual specialist accreditation in General Adult Psychiatry and Addiction Psychiatry and is based in Glasgow.</p>
            <p>He was a Consultant Psychiatrist with NHS Lanarkshire from 2010 to 2022 and is lead clinician for General Adult and Addiction Psychiatry at Priory Hospital Glasgow.</p>
          </section>
          <section class="editorial-section">
            <h2>Qualifications &amp; experience</h2>
            <p>MBBS · MRCPsych · MSc Alcohol and Drug Addiction · FRCPsych.</p>
            <p>Accreditation as a Civil Expert Witness from the University of Aberdeen and Family Expert Witness Accreditation from Cardiff University.</p>
          </section>
          <section class="editorial-section">
            <h2>Independent psychiatric opinion</h2>
            <p>His medico-legal work involves psychiatric assessment and reporting for legal, insurance and professional matters. Each instruction is considered on its own clinical and evidential merits.</p>
            <a class="button button-dark" href="/instructions">Discuss an instruction ↗</a>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
